Z||000000||TRiAD||12-21-2001||06:06 PM||||JefrySuko and NOCONES are coming over tomorrow to help finish the clutch system stuff, and a few other sorted (sordid? LOL!) items. <BR>I'm in Central Illinois (close to Peoria), and anyone's welcome. <P>email ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com<BR>AIM ~ Michael Blue 72<BR>or call ~ 309-266-6442<BR>if you would like info or directions. <P>We'll be here most of the day, I suspect, fiddling with the car and playing GT3, Twisted Metal Black, or whatever. <P>Unfortunately, I can't provide food or anything, but feel free to bring some change and I'm sure everyone would want to pitch in for a pizza or something. <P>Anyway, just thought I'd offer. I'll be taking pics if many Fieros show up, and will post the day's events (and whether my car is back on the road or not) here when the day is done!<P>Thanks to everyone here for all your help so far, especially JefrySuko, NOCONES, Hugh, John Cromer (sorry, don't know your forum name), Fiero Bob and Archie!<P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0NgAAAMsSN*Wryq60N*CeWB!hXjfeIaMEc1YxPH9aPzaIXm!17ZpdBFE0Yk*d*dHNFG*GR3SFyLa8KJgh1IKe2Q/xmas-sig.jpg">       <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="red">Merry Christmas!</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B><BR>Photoshop rendition of planned modifications<BR>AIM ~ Michael Blue 72</I></FONT>||||reg||6
