Z||000011||TRiAD||12-23-2001||09:34 PM||||<B><I><FONT COLOR="blue">UPDATE!</FONT></B></I><P>OK, we put the "new" (used) clutch master cylinder in and began to bleed the system. <BR>There is still a leak, and it appears to be one of the seals that come in the rebuild kit. <BR>It seems like it probably just sat "dry" too long and dried out the seals. <P>I'll be ordering a rebuild kit tomorrow (unless someone has one they need to sell/donate ~ email ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com tonight!) and we'll likely be getting together again this weekend to finish it. <P>I'll keep you posted. Thanks again to everyone who's helped so far in any way!<BR><p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 12-23-2001).]||||reg||1
